      "writtenOn": "2017-10-10T18:40:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "With only int values, it is hard to deal with cases like \"MNC\u003d90\" and \"MNC\u003d090\", which would be identified as the same MNC in int values.",
      "parentUuid": "0e4ee2bf_f193c804",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 45,
        "startChar": 4,
