      "writtenOn": "2017-10-10T17:47:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The reason I asked about the empty string is that typically null is used as a default value rather than empty string.  Other classes (e.g. ServiceState) in this namespace use null to present unknown / not specified (see ServiceState.java), so being consistent would be good.",
